// FLAT, NOT RAISED. This carried MUI's three-layer elevation shadow — the
// stacked rgba(0,0,0,.2)/.14/.12 triple that paints a card as a sheet of paper
// lifted off the page — plus a 6px 6px 0 0 radius that rounded only its top
// corners, so two sections in a column met at a seam that read as one torn
// card rather than as two.
//
// A section is now a plain white field separated by a hairline rule, which is
// how the rest of this surface's controls are drawn. Nothing here sits on a
// z-axis: the boundary is the border, and there is no shadow at any depth.
.setting-section
  background $prose_paper
  border 1px solid $prose_rule
  border-radius 3px
  padding 20px

  + .setting-section
    margin-top 16px

  h2
    margin 0 0 4px
    font-family $prose_mono
    font-weight $prose_bold
    font-size 13px
    letter-spacing 0.14em
    text-transform uppercase
    color $prose_muted
